> I have recorded quite[ a] few CDs. I[ recommend] "[Rel]iable Transportation" - my first cd. Also "The Innocent Bystand[ers] Volumes I & II" and "Ed Dowling and the Moments Live at the[ Spirit] Room" I played with[ the Innocent Bystanders] for 15 years or so. We[ were a newgrass band] with a unique style and sound. We played every Saturday and Sunday afternoon at the Spirit Room in Jerome, Arizona for most of the[ 1980]'s. There are some nice original[ tunes] on the 2[ CD] set[ which] was recorded live at the Spirit Room in 1987. I am trying[ to] provide as many of the tunes as[ possible] for free download and[ listening]. The cds are $10 each plus shipping.
